{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54555","headline":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 十六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"降兵气，髣髴状如楼。\n兼有似人形黑赤，或如（京本作「如逢」）山岳立（辛本、川本、京本作「覆」）岗丘（京本作「头」），其下有戈矛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54555.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54555","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}